exports[`DesktopUpdateSettings > snapshots the user-visible update states and explicit actions 1`] = `
"<div><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="unsupported"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg><span><h3>此环境不支持桌面更新</h3><p>请在已安装的 CrewON 桌面应用中检查更新。</p></span></section></div></div></section><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="checking"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-loader-circle settings-loading-spinner" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-6.219-8.56"></path></svg><span><h3>正在检查更新</h3><p>正在读取已签名的桌面更新清单…</p></span></section></div><div class="settings-actions"><button type="button" disabled="">正在检查…</button></div></div></section><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="current"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span><h3>CrewON 已是最新版本</h3><p>当前没有可用的桌面更新。</p></span></section></div><div class="settings-actions"><button type="button">检查更新</button></div></div></section><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="available"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"></line></svg><span><h3>CrewON 0.3.0 可安装</h3><p>安装会先下载并校验更新，成功后重新启动应用。</p></span><p class="settings-update-notes">修复恢复流程
改进设置体验</p></section></div><div class="settings-actions"><button data-tone="primary" type="button">安装并重启</button></div></div></section><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="downloading"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-download" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"></line></svg><span><h3>正在安装 CrewON 0.3.0</h3><p>请保持应用打开；安装成功后才会重新启动。</p></span><progress aria-label="更新下载进度" max="1" value="0.625"></progress></section></div></div></section><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="ready"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span><h3>CrewON 0.3.0 已安装</h3><p>正在重新启动应用…</p></span></section></div></div></section><section class="settings-group" data-desktop-update="failed"><h2>应用更新</h2><div class="settings-card"><div class="settings-summary-sections"><section class="settings-summary-section settings-update-summary" role="alert"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span><h3>更新未完成</h3><p>签名校验失败</p></span></section></div><div class="settings-actions"><button type="button">重新检查</button></div></div></section></div>"
